[Music]  in less than half a year james gunn's  newest superhero movie the suicide squad  will be out and we now have a whole lot  of new  info on the dc blockbuster to share with  you according to the official synopsis  part of the action takes place in  bellrep  the prison with the highest mortality  rate in the u.s  to escape from it all many super  villains joined task force x  including bloodsport peacemaker captain  boomerang ratcatcher  kingshark blackheart javelin and of  course  harley quinn they must then not only  make their way through rough terrain and  a secluded island but they must defeat  the anime gorilla forces as well  in the merciless fight for survival the  rule any mistake is lethal  applies and as gun has already  emphasized many times in the past  he does not hesitate to give his  characters early on-screen deaths  on twitter the director is also heating  up the anticipation for margo roby's  harley quinn as the 54 year old is  looking forward to her entrance the most  in a few days the shooting will be done  and there will be more news to be  excited about  soon since there will be some unexpected  appearances and gun assured us that the  long-awaited trailer will be released  before may  the us release date of this suicide  squad will then be on august 6  2021 shortly before the end of  production on mission impossible 7  deadline reports that the long-term  planned project of shooting part 7 and  part 8 simultaneously has now been  scrapped one reason for this is tom  cruise's long announced promo tour for  the follow-up to the cult film top gun  which is scheduled for u.s release on  july 2nd this year  the plan is to continue with mission  impossible aid shortly after the release  of top gun maverick  further causes the more difficult  filming conditions due to the pandemic  as was already seen in the filming of  mission impossible 7 which was  repeatedly interrupted  behind the scenes however nothing  changes so christopher mcquarrie will of  course also take over the direction of  mission impossible 8  the release dates of the two movies have  not changed as of  yet part 7 will still be released on  november 19th  2021 while the sequel will be released  one year later on november 4th  2022 well over a decade ago producer and  director rm pellet released the first  part of the now world famous horror  series  paranormal activity what made it special  his surprise had grossed a staggering  193 million us dollars on a mere 15 000  budget after several sequels and a  spin-off it's now time for a new one and  media reports confirmed that the entire  paranormal activity brand is to be  renewed for  theaters rumors have been circulating  for some time that the new part was  imminent but the fact that the entire  franchise is being revamped and started  from scratch  was not apparent until now concrete  details about the content are still  scarce at this point but it's more than  likely that we'll see a return of the  all tried and true  found footage material underwater  director will eubank is expected to be  in the director's chair while happy  death day director christophe lennon  will be in charge of the film script  behind the scenes paranormal activity  will get support from horror producer  jason blum  alongside the creator of the first part  orrin pillai the us release of  paranormal activity is so far scheduled  for march 4th  2022 originally a third film about the  popular children's book character  paddington bear was supposed to be  released at the end of last year as so  often happens behind the scenes however  they could not bring themselves to begin  production and so the project was put on  hold for an  indefinite period of time as variety now  reports though  those responsible studio canal have  finally given the green light as actor  hugh boneville also confirmed in a radio  interview  paul king the screenwriter and director  of the two predecessors announced on  this occasion  that he would no longer be directly  involved on the set and would instead  take on the role of producer  those involved are still silent about  further information on paddington 3 but  king at least shared that with the end  of the current script  there was still plenty of room for  further sequels  either way we are excited and we look  forward to hearing more news about  paddington 3. spider-man into the  spider-verse was packed with  nasty villains led of course by wilson  fisk aka kingpin  after part 2 has been announced for a  long time rumors about a new villain  appearing in the sequel have begun to  pile up lately  this site murphy's multiverse reports  that dr jonathan  on better known as the spot will become  one of miles morales adversaries  fans may already be familiar with a spot  from the comics or from the new  spider-man series  but it is a nice idea indeed to  introduce a new villain outside of the  animated series from the 90s  the scientist spot made the first comic  book appearance back in 1984 when he was  researching ways and means to multiply  cloak superpowers  after a change of dimension his body was  suddenly covered with  many black dots that he could enlarge or  shrink and will to use as  portals after discovering his mighty  superpower he finally decided to live as  a villain and fought the likes of  spider-man  and daredevil currently it is difficult  to tell how true the rumors about the  spot's appearance in spider-man into the  spider-verse 2  are but we will keep you up to date as  [Music]  always  [Music]  you

